2026-11-05T16:09:19.2131890Z  	    -- `GRANT inv_audit_reader TO audit_bridge; GRANT audit_bridge TO inv_app` the
2026-11-05T16:09:19.2132180Z  	    -- runtime role assumes the reader transitively and the check would pass. It
2026-11-05T16:09:19.2132473Z  	    -- would also let an unrelated pre-existing login become a cross-tenant audit
2026-11-05T16:09:19.2132755Z  	    -- reader with no review. Every membership chain that reaches this role has a
